# EXPERIMENTAL's MAVSerial pass against SITL (temp.cs:310-408): pressed, MAVLinkSerialPort is made
# on GPS1 for the vehicle (MAVLinkSerialPort.cs:53-78) and a TcpListener started on 0.0.0.0:500;
# pressed again, the port is closed - SERIAL_CONTROL with no flags, the GPS handed back - and the
# listener with it (crates/mp-gui/src/mav_serial.rs).
#
# Port 500 is below 1024: a machine that lets this user listen there (root, or a lowered
# net.ipv4.ip_unprivileged_port_start) listens, and one that does not refuses, the status line
# saying why where the C# shows the exception in a box. The script holds on either, by the fact
# that names the outcome - experimental.mavserial, "listening on 0.0.0.0:500" or "refused:
# 0.0.0.0:500: <why>" - both of which name the address the listener was asked for, which neither
# earlier refusal (no link, no vehicle; experimental-actions.gui) reaches. Pressed again, one
# listening is closed and one refused is refused again: neither is listening. A client's bytes to
# the GPS and the GPS's back are mav_serial.rs's tests, over a fake link, as this script has no
# client to connect.
#
# Run as: tools/gui-test.sh tests/gui/experimental-mavserial.gui -- tcp:127.0.0.1:5760
screen fly
window 1600x1200
budget 9
# 9: 7.2 s measured headless on lavapipe (2026-10-16), the rule's ceiling plus one.
env XDG_DATA_HOME $WORK
env MP_CONFIG_XML $WORK/config.xml
setup printf '<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?><Config><tabcontrolactions>tabQuick;</tabcontrolactions></Config>' > "$WORK/config.xml"

within 30
expect vehicle.count > 0
key ctrl+f
expect screen experimental
expect experimental.working 33

# Pressed: listening, or refused with the reason, either naming the address.
click experimental-but_mavserialport
expect experimental.last but_mavserialport
expect experimental.mavserial ~ 0.0.0.0:500
expect experimental.mavserial !~ Please connect first
expect experimental.mavserial !~ No valid heartbeats
expect status ~ 0.0.0.0:500

# Pressed again: nothing listening.
click experimental-but_mavserialport
expect experimental.mavserial !~ listening
